    "text": "Ozone in solid state is violet-black solid.<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3ce32f37-ddb8-4546-9e31-44f54c946e9f-image.png\" style=\"width: 209px; height: 142px;\" /><br />All paired electrons, so it is diamagnetic as per Lewis structure.<br />ONCl &ndash; no. of electrons = 32<br />ONO<sup>&ndash;</sup> &ndash; no. of electrons = 24<br /><br />They are not isoelectronic.<br /><br />O<sub>3</sub> has bent structure with Bond angle 116.8<sup>o .</sup>",
